{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415509","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415509","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1041550901:1":{"text":"なかなか凝った内装だなあ……","source_cn":"你们这里的布置……很有设计感啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88D946BC1C1AA095","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041550902:1":{"text":"布の色の組み合わせとか模様とか、外の花火に合わせてるのか？","source_cn":"彩缎的颜色搭配，还有这里的花样，是呼应了外面的焰火吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1398CE78D7F4784","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041550903:1":{"text":"ええと、私にはよく分かりませんが、ドリーさんはこういうのが得意なんですよ！","source_cn":"唔，设计思路我是不清楚啦，但多莉小姐一直很有搭配的想法！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55CC5E390D92CF48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041550904:1":{"text":"ロワンさんは今回の春焔の飾り付け、お気に召しましたか？","source_cn":"罗万喜欢这次的春焰庆装饰吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3C3BAD27353FBF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041550905:1":{"text":"ああ、とくにこの提灯がいいな。","source_cn":"嗯，尤其喜欢这些灯笼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x404B392AC30FD91C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041550906:1":{"text":"金貨の形をした提灯なんて、商人なら誰だって気に入ると思うぞ。","source_cn":"犹如金币一般的造型，无论是哪个商人都不会忽视吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x306C5D766F8E4973","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041550907:1":{"text":"あとでうちにも卸してくれないか聞いてみようかな。きっと人気が出ると思うんだ。","source_cn":"等一会儿我要去问问，能不能授权给我在外零售，想必销路会不错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A1F4708111DC10D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041550908:1":{"text":"ふふ、常に商売のチャンスを見逃さないところがロワンさんらしいですね！","source_cn":"罗万的商业视角还是一样这么敏锐呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AD6A12ECE58BCD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:罗万":{"text":"ロワン","source":"罗万","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}